WEBVTT

00:00:01.614 --> 00:00:04.514
Open Labs → STT in the sidebar

00:00:04.514 --> 00:00:09.930
Pick the language and turn on punctuation

00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:12.890
Upload a WAV, MP3, FLAC or M4A file

00:00:12.890 --> 00:00:16.064
The transcript and audio length appear

00:00:16.064 --> 00:00:23.000
Code shows the same request in TypeScript, Python and cURL

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:32.592
Logs lists every request; click one for its details

00:00:32.592 --> 00:00:38.332
Usage tracks requests, audio processed and credits

00:00:38.332 --> 00:00:41.240
Pricing shows the rate for your currency

00:00:41.240 --> 00:00:45.625
The SDK needs an API key: Settings → API key

00:00:45.625 --> 00:00:52.660
Copy it once and store it as RINGG_API_KEY
